# ============================================================================
# Trivy waiver file (devops.md §2 / CLAUDE.md non-negotiable).
#
# A HIGH/CRITICAL vulnerability with an available fix BLOCKS the build
# (.github/workflows/ci.yml, trivy-scan job). The ONLY way to suppress a
# specific finding is a dated, signed entry below -- never a silent
# severity-threshold change in the workflow file.
#
# Entry format (one CVE per waiver, reviewed every release):
#
#   # CVE-XXXX-XXXXX -- <package>@<version>
#   # Reason: <why this is not exploitable in this app's context>
#   # Waived by: <name/handle>, <YYYY-MM-DD>
#   # Review by: <YYYY-MM-DD, max +90 days out>
#   CVE-XXXX-XXXXX
#
# No waivers exist yet -- this file is intentionally empty of entries.
# ============================================================================
